// Generated from the output of a local Go program that runs azidentity
// v1.15.0 (MSAL Go v1.10.1) InteractiveBrowserCredential against a fake
// transport with invented hosts, its browser a scratch hook passed to
// MSAL's WithOpenURL (no process started); do not edit (the scratch tool
// mkpubvec.py). The listener's port, the state, the PKCE challenge and
// verifier are masked. Each request is its method and URL (an empty
// query's `?` dropped: Xo's URL has none), its headers (lower case,
// sorted; client-request-id's UUID masked; MSAL's x-client-* telemetry
// headers dropped: this port sends none), and its body; then what the
// browser was answered and each result.

